          "kind": "struct",
          "name": "Documented",
          "docs": ["Documentation of several lines.", "", "It can hold Markdown's `code spans`, non-ASCII text such as å, 世界 and", "🦀, and text that closes a comment or string in some language: */, \"\"\",", "a backslash \\ and a trailing quote\"", "", "Javadoc and `JSDoc` read it as text, with HTML's <b>, &amp; and &,", "Javadoc's {@link Object} and `{@code x}`, Java's Unicode escape \\u000A,", "and a tag at the start of a line:", "@deprecated"],
